  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital Security and Completion of Reports RAU</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Digital Security och Slutf&#xf6;rande av rapporter RAUD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The Research and Advocacy Unit has applied to Sida for funding of 497 350 SEK to carry out the &quot;Digital Security and Completion of Reports&quot; in Southern Africa (Zimbabwe) during the period 1  November 2014 to 28 February 2015. 

The intervention aims to reconstruct the RAU website on a more stable platform as the main interface with the public and also complete, publish and disseminate 5 reports on a variety of relevant current affairs issues. RAU will directly implement the intervention. 

The intervention&#x2019;s total budget is 497 350 SEK, and the total is being supported through the Embassy of Sweden and there are no other donors.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives are to support the reconstruction of the RAU website   migrating it to a more stable platform which acts as the main         interface with the public. Secondly support will also be channelled   to the ccompletion, publishing and dissemination of  5 reports on a   variety of relevant current democratic affairs in Zimbabwe.</narrative>
  </description>
